         "minimum": 1,
         "type": "integer"
        },
        "every": {
         "description": "Seconds between cycle STARTS. Defaults to the cycle's own span (back-to-back). A LARGER value holds the last value in the gap \u2014 that is how you get a pulse every 2s instead of a constant wobble. Shorter than the cycle is rejected, because the cycles would overlap and collide on the same frames.",
         "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
         "type": "number"
